# Factorials, recursive and with a loop: 20! is the largest that fits.
# expect: 1 1 120 2432902008176640000 3628800

# n -- n!
define fact dup 1 gt if dup 1 sub fact mul else drop 1 then end

# n -- n!, counting down with the product under the counter
define fact-loop 1 swap begin dup 1 gt if swap over mul swap 1 sub false else true then until drop end

0 fact
1 fact
5 fact
20 fact
10 fact-loop
